<title>USA: Arkansas Best Corp Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Arkansas Best Corp Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>FORT SMITH, Ark. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31		 1997	  1996</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES</p>
<p> LTL motor carrier operations		$296,535    $294,923</p>
<p> Intermodal operations			   44,789	41,766</p>
<p> Truckload motor carrier operations	  19,021	17,838</p>
<p> Logistics operations			    12,134	13,230</p>
<p> Tire operations				   32,094	31,613</p>
<p> Service and other				  2,173	 2,004</p>
<p> Total						406,746     401,374</p>
<p> Net loss					     (317)     (9,559)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share		     (0.07)	(0.54)</p>
<p> Average Common Shares Outstanding     19,504,473  19,516,539</p>
<p>	     (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Gives consideration to preferred stock dividends of $1.1 million per quarter.</p>
<p>(2) Does not assume conversion of preferred stock to common stock because conversion would be anti-dilutive for these periods.</p>
<p>(3) Intermodal operations were formerly referred to as Forwarding operations.</p>
</text>
